B.b1f=new A.cM(B.aoK,"Al-Wasia Academy teaches the letters of the Qur\u2019an, one gentle step at a time: 28 letters in 4 units, each unit ending with an exam. There are also word decks, tajweed cards, and a du\u2019a school in the Academy. Which would you like to explore \u2014 letters, words, or du\u2019as?")
B.and=s(["how many lessons","how many letters","how long","how many units","structure"],t.s)
B.b1W=new A.cM(B.and,"The letters school has 28 lessons in 4 units of 7 lessons each \u2014 Unit 1 \u201cThe First Letters\u201d, Unit 2 \u201cThe Middle Letters\u201d, Unit 3 \u201cThe Deep Letters\u201d, Unit 4 \u201cThe Final Letters\u201d. One short lesson a day is a beautiful pace. Would you like to know what today\u2019s lesson could be?")
