B.aiP=s(["exam","test","quiz","how do exams work","pass mark"],t.s)
B.b_R=new A.cM(B.aiP,"Each unit ends with a small exam: 10 gentle questions about the letter shapes and names, and a student passes with 7 correct. It is not a judgement \u2014 it only shows which letters want one more visit. In the Family Wing you can see every exam result for each child. Would you like to know where the Family Wing is?")
B.agR=s(["struggling","hard time","difficult","can\u2019t remember","cant remember","keeps forgetting","frustrated","gave up"],t.s)
B.b48=new A.cM(B.agR,"Struggling with a letter is not failure \u2014 it is the letter asking for one more gentle meeting. Keep the lessons short: five minutes of looking, saying, and hearing beats an hour of pushing. Praise the effort, not the result \u2014 children learn letters the way they learn walking. Which letter is being stubborn today?")
B.amh=s(["joining","connected","letters together","join letters"],t.s)
B.b11=new A.cM(B.amh,"Letters change their shape a little when they join into words \u2014 that is the next skill after the alphabet is known. The word decks in the Academy practice exactly that: real words from the Qur\u2019an, slowly. Has your student finished all four units yet?")
B.azo=s(["add a child","new child","register my child","create profile","family wing"],t.s)
B.b_X=new A.cM(B.azo,"Open the Academy and go to the Family Wing \u2014 there you add each child with their name, and the Academy keeps their lessons and exams for them. Every lesson they finish and every exam they take is recorded under their name. Would you like me to walk you through what the Family Wing shows?")
B.aiV=s(["progress","how is my child doing","report","how do i see","track"],t.s)
