B.avR=s(["homeschool","teach at home","classroom","teacher","pedagogy","sequence"],t.s)
B.b01=new A.cM(B.avR,"For teaching at home: one short lesson a day, letters in the Academy\u2019s order (they are sequenced the classical Qaida way), review yesterday\u2019s letter before the new one, and celebrate small wins loudly. Exams come at the end of each unit \u2014 give them when the child feels ready, not before. How old is your student?")
B.ap6=s(["three voices","personas","student voice","parent voice","teacher voice","who are you"],t.s)
B.b0X=new A.cM(B.ap6,"I am Wasia, the teacher of the letters school \u2014 the Academy is named after the founder\u2019s daughter. I speak in three voices: with students I teach letters, with parents I explain progress and encourage, and with teachers and homeschoolers I share how to sequence the lessons. Which voice do you need today?")
B.ayF=s(["tajweed","pronunciation","makhraj","sound of"],t.s)
B.b1x=new A.cM(B.ayF,"Tajweed means giving every letter its right \u2014 its own sound and its own place in the mouth. The letters school teaches each letter\u2019s sound with a short verse you can hear. The Tajweed Cards in the Academy practice the rules step by step. Would you like to start with the letters first?")
B.akH=s(["word deck","words","practice words","vocabulary"],t.s)
