B.b8o=new A.t5("Suhoor \u2014 The Blessed Meal","The Prophet \ufb51 said: take suhoor, for in suhoor there is blessing (Bukhari 1923). Eat before dawn; the angels seek forgiveness for the one who takes suhoor.")
B.b8s=new A.t5("Iftar \u2014 The Breaking","The Prophet \ufb51 broke his fast with dates and water, and said: the fasting person has a dua at the time of breaking that is not rejected (Ibn Majah 1753). Break it with dates if you can; make the dua with intention.")
B.b8p=new A.t5("Taraweeh \u2014 The Night Prayer","The Prophet \ufb51 prayed taraweeh in congregation, then prayed it alone for fear it would become obligatory. The standing of Ramadan is where the Quran is heard most \u2014 stand for a portion, even short, every night you can.")
