B.aK6=new A.dS(["The Cave of Thawr","Three days in silence","With Abu Bakr beside him, and the hunters at the mouth of the cave, he said: \u201cdo not grieve; indeed Allah is with us\u201d (9:40). A spider\u2019s web covered the entrance.","Qur\u2019an 9:40"])
B.aK2=new A.dS(["The Road North","Suraqa and the changing of the earth","The rider chasing the bounty \u2014 a hundred camels \u2014 was thrown twice from his horse as the ground seized it. He asked for a letter of safety and rode home guarding the document he had come to kill for.","Sahih al-Bukhari 3905"])
B.aJO=new A.dS(["Quba","The first mosque","Fourteen days building Masjid Quba \u2014 \u201ca mosque founded on righteousness from the first day\u201d (9:108) \u2014 before entering the city.","Qur\u2019an 9:108"])
B.aJJ=new A.dS(["Madinah","The city that ran to meet him","Every roof emptied; every voice called the takbir; the date-palms were crowded with people. The hijrah was complete \u2014 and history\u2019s calendar began again from that year.","Seerah: Ibn Ishaq"])
B.mf=s([B.aJZ,B.aK6,B.aK2,B.aJO,B.aJJ],t.wa)
